    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>You arrive at your apartment complex after a hard day's work, but something isn't right. The elevator is broken, the lights are dimmed and the whole layout feels wrong. You ask yourself, is this place even real?<br><br>As you ascend the staircase towards the 9th floor, where your apartment is located, you get an ominous feeling that something or someone doesn't want you there.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>ENDLOOP is horror game where you are stuck in a stairway loop. You need to solve puzzles, escape random rooms and stay away from danger to progress and hopefully escape with your life still intact.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Infinite stairway<br></li><li> Randomized events<br></li><li> Puzzles based on logic and observation<br></li><li> Random rooms with escape room like gameplay<br></li><li> Every playthrough is different<br></li><li> Multiple endings</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steaming</h2>Streaming and monetize is allowed if name and link to the game is present in the description.",
